# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# --- Signing secrets (NEVER commit) -------------------------------------------
# The release keystore and its passwords. The upload key is effectively
# permanent: Android will not update an installed app signed with a different
# key, so losing these means every future release needs a full uninstall.
# Back them up outside the repo instead of committing them.
/android/key.properties
/android/app/*.jks
/android/app/*.keystore
*.jks
*.keystore

# Logo generator scratch output (the committed icons are the source of truth).
/tool/logo/out/
